+
+
+## Bugfix factual-label evidence at analysis handoff
+
+Before marking ANALYSIS completed or entering PLANNING, validate
+`workspace_dir/suspect-labels.json` with `suspect_labels.py --check`. Record
+its exact file SHA256 in `states.ANALYSIS.suspect_labels_sha256`. The installed
+`suspect-labeling-guard.py` rejects missing/unfinished/mixed-source/tampered
+observations and absent or mismatched bindings at subsequent state writes.
+An actual failed label-tool receipt is recorded as unavailable, never as an
+empty successful candidate set. This observation artifact neither confirms
+root cause nor relaxes the existing reproduction/oracle/selection gates.
